**Phase 3 — shipped (2026-06-10):**
- **`DeloadAdvisor`** (pure): transparent additive fatigue score over a 14-day window — effort
  inflation (+2: ≥50% HARD/BRUTAL bouts at flat-or-down volume), intra-session rep drop-off (+1),
  e1RM regression on ≥2 lifts (+2), low mood in ≥3 of last 5 check-ins (+2), cardio restReason
  sick (+2) / sore (+1), no deload in 8+ weeks (+1), ≥3 plateaued lifts (+1, reuses System 1).
