discard the coach's applied changes (the overlay reconcile clears them — correct for stale
bindings, but it forgot months of learning on every re-roll). Now every generate/re-roll path
(`ProgramRepository.generate` + `rerollDay`, so Settings generate, deload, manual + auto
rotation all inherit it) enriches its params from the coach record via pure
`domain/coach/CoachGenBias`:
- **volumeBias** — net still-APPLIED volume_up/volume_down per muscle (reverted/skipped drop
  out), clamped ±2 (the drift cap) → `GenerationParams.volumeBias` →
  `VolumeModel.allocate(bias)`: each +1 lands on the muscle's smallest slot, each −1 off its
  largest, BEFORE the weekly cap (junk-volume guard still wins).
- **prefer** — swap replacements the watcher judged "ok" → unioned into `liked` (boosted).
- **avoid** — failed swap replacements → `GenerationParams.avoid`, soft ×0.2 selection penalty
  (a later "ok" on the same movement outranks an earlier failure).
Recomputed from the same rows on every call → idempotent, never compounds; empty history =
exactly the un-coached generator. Tests: 7 CoachGenBias + 3 VolumeModel bias + 2 generator
(avoid steering, bias flow-through).

**Flat vs incline bench fix (2026-06-10, Antho's correction):** his bench is a straight FLAT
bench (its bar is benching-only; barbell isn't modeled) — NOT adjustable, and the old single
`BENCH` equipment let incline movements (Incline DB Bench, Chest-Supported DB Row, DB Incline
Curl) into his MWM-989 plans. New `Equipment.INCLINE_BENCH` ("Incline bench"; BENCH renamed
"Flat bench"); those 3 movements retagged; the MWM-989 preset deliberately excludes it (Full gym
includes it automatically). Generation AND swap picker both filter by it. Regression test:
`mwmPresetNeverProducesInclineBenchMovements` (plans across 3–6 days × 10 seeds + swap
candidates for every muscle).

**Three more removed per Antho (2026-06-10):** Face Pull + Seated Low Row claimed MWM-989
stations his machine can't perform (speculative pro-audit additions — DELETED outright, same
philosophy as the old barbell removal); DB Hip Thrust is impossible against his rack bench —
also deleted. Library = 57 movements. Consequences accepted: rear delts back to 1 MWM option
(Rear Delt DB Fly), glutes pool = lunge/bridge/kickback/outer-kick. **App total: 282 unit
tests.**

